193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 100 0 R
/T (The exponential growth in multi-device usage has transformed how users work and share digital content. However, existing le-sharing solutions email, messaging applications, cloud storage, and USB devices fall short in combining speed, ease of use, and robust privacy protection. ChromaSafe is a Chrome browser extension enabling secure, real-time, device-to-device transfer with end-to-end encryption, eliminating the need for third-party cloud storage services. The extension leverages AES-256-GCM symmetric encryption and ECDH \(Elliptic Curve Di e-Hellman\) key exchange via the WebCrypto API, ensuring no plaintext data reaches the server. Communication between paired devices utilizes Socket.io connected to Node.js backend that functions purely as a relay mechanism without accessing or storing le content. This zero-knowledge architecture guarantees complete data privacy. The nal deliverable is a lightweight, highly secure, and reliable solution for personal and professional le-sharing requirements, addressing critical gaps by providing instant transmission, guaranteed privacy through encryption, browser integration, and seamless cross-device pairing.)
/E (The exponential growth in multi-device usage has transformed how users work and share digital content. However, existing le-sharing solutions email, messaging applications, cloud storage, and USB devices fall short in combining speed, ease of use, and robust privacy protection. ChromaSafe is a Chrome browser extension enabling secure, real-time, device-to-device transfer with end-to-end encryption, eliminating the need for third-party cloud storage services. The extension leverages AES-256-GCM symmetric encryption and ECDH \(Elliptic Curve Di e-Hellman\) key exchange via the WebCrypto API, ensuring no plaintext data reaches the server. Communication between paired devices utilizes Socket.io connected to Node.js backend that functions purely as a relay mechanism without accessing or storing le content. This zero-knowledge architecture guarantees complete data privacy. The nal deliverable is a lightweight, highly secure, and reliable solution for personal and professional le-sharing requirements, addressing critical gaps by providing instant transmission, guaranteed privacy through encryption, browser integration, and seamless cross-device pairing.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
