451 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 112 0 R
/E (This table presents performance benchmarks for ChromaSafe file transfers across various file sizes, measuring encryption, transmission, and decryption times in milliseconds. Results demonstrate that encryption and decryption operations scale linearly with file size, with hardware-accelerated AES-GCM operations from the WebCrypto API providing rapid processing. Transmission times vary based on network conditions. A 1 MB file completes in 25 ms total, while a 500 MB file requires 9.6 seconds demonstrating practical performance for real-world usage scenarios.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [26]
>>
